{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat specification/INTENT.md specification/PRODUCT.md .qualification/OWNER.json .agents/skills/stdo-work/source-routes.json && python3 -c 'from pathlib import Path; import hashlib; paths=[\\\"inputs/name.txt\\\",\\\"outputs/greeting.txt\\\",\\\"unrelated/sentinel.txt\\\"]; [(print(p,repr(Path(p).read_bytes()),hashlib.sha256(Path(p).read_bytes()).hexdigest())) for p in paths]'\"","aggregated_output":"# Intent\nKeep the greeting artifact consistent with the selected name.\n# Greeting artifact fixture\n\n## Product boundary\nMaintain one UTF-8 greeting artifact for the selected input name. This disposable fixture has no publication or deployment authority.\n\n## Construction authority\nThe owner authorizes the bounded correction described in TASK.md. Use the existing requirement and design. Only outputs/greeting.txt is the subject artifact; unrelated/sentinel.txt is outside the mutation scope.\n{\n  \"authority\": \"Root selected HOST_EVIDENCE_PLAN a831a5cc21683aa517264029cb822db5baf2a2de2dedee83f20157c5675a08e6 and this bounded preparation; actual dispatch still requires Root selection\",\n  \"mechanism\": {\n    \"id\": \"product-policy-preflight/1\",\n    \"implementation_sha256\": \"bf72a28444e0497cd564066e41c7e5943810d5a2e0be5488c92fa5add5a67209\",\n    \"source\": {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"build_tenants/graphify/code/ac_support_core.py\",\n      \"root\": \"tool\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"bf72a28444e0497cd564066e41c7e5943810d5a2e0be5488c92fa5add5a67209\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"result_surface\": {\n    \"consumer\": \"qualification-executive\",\n    \"namespace\": \"results\",\n    \"root\": \"/private/tmp/stdo-skills-qualification-yfa1t8ik/codex-automatic/control/evidence\"\n  },\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"case\": \"automatic\",\n    \"forbidden\": [\n      \"Git\",\n      \"remote publication\",\n      \"global configuration\",\n      \"oracle acquisition\",\n      \"unrelated mutation\"\n    ],\n    \"host_artifact_writes\": [\n      \"outputs/greeting.txt\"\n    ],\n    \"physical_executor_writes\": [\n      \"control/actor-output\"\n    ],\n    \"projection\": \"Pinned launcher forwards only the exact selected ordinary prompt; context bookkeeping remains with operator\",\n    \"purpose\": \"Owner-selected finite skill qualification; no host semantic result preaccepted\",\n    \"selection_sha256\": \"7b30c341558167423d5710eb8801c278866e01a3d9cc64bb8311cfd072e2a88a\"\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"schema\": \"stdo-skills.codex.source-routes/1\",\n  \"standing\": \"construction provenance; target workspace supplies its own definition and grants\",\n  \"method\": {\n    \"uri\": \"stdo://releases/v3.0.1-rc.1/\",\n    \"manifest_sha256\": \"60356364a412dbde8cffe68fe0eda4e2749b0162acce93495534eee13b223df8\"\n  },\n  \"sources\": [\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"specification/PRODUCT.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"7e667a594717645aa51fa23b757a95283ad60e5eca4e59d24246a62ce2716803\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"specification/INTENT.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"c6c8d5083ce154fa5f1782b4a789c4ff96b65a18eabc28339c79857b131ad895\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"specification/requirements/README.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"dcc2564e597d3d3c8fcff025a515f4a92a62e7f3aa2f7ba80af97f7db75f6acc\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"specification/requirements/SCENARIOS.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n     