the governing files. Native a_c source acquisition, observations and work.write are available through TOOLING.md. Read/compute and ordinary parent-directory creation inside the selected output territory are permitted. No Git, network publication, external deployment, global configuration or unrelated changes are authorized.\\n\",\"coordinates\":null,\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"fcd0da4ebac96a38dd22b1aa29746be5a87d16e9843279cb7e241fa798e8bf58\",\"selected_sha256\":\"fcd0da4ebac96a38dd22b1aa29746be5a87d16e9843279cb7e241fa798e8bf58\",\"size_bytes\":515,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"TASK.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":null,\"sha256\":\"fcd0da4ebac96a38dd22b1aa29746be5a87d16e9843279cb7e241fa798e8bf58\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
