{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_34","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"/opt/homebrew/Cellar/python@3.13/3.13.7/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/3.13/bin/python3.13 -B /Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/a_c/build_tenants/graphify/code/ac_support.py --policy /private/tmp/stdo-skills-qualification-yfa1t8ik/codex-automatic/control/worker-policy.json --policy-sha256 dfa33c0b897fbdd8924208350830f83b66abfe832ae48468696783bd68ee3022 --principal host call --request - <<'JSON'\n{\\\"schema\\\":\\\"a_c.fd-support.request/1\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"greeting-final-basis-1-1\\\",\\\"operation\\\":\\\"source.read\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"source\\\":{\\\"engine\\\":\\\"workspace-regular-file\\\",\\\"object\\\":null,\\\"root\\\":\\\"method\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"standards/ACTIVATION.md\\\",\\\"sha256\\\":\\\"56109ffa2e8ec6f158e6dbd0b387fededa685abc100a288ea88525854a78441d\\\",\\\"selector\\\":{\\\"lines\\\":[1750,1768]}},\\\"encoding\\\":\\\"utf8\\\"}}\nJSON\"","aggregated_output":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:00e4a9887255dd5f617f8aff1dcbdfb7b9f4da5f55f4389c575844988f03ccd4\",\"sha256\":\"00e4a9887255dd5f617f8aff1dcbdfb7b9f4da5f55f4389c575844988f03ccd4\"},\"id\":\"greeting-final-basis-1-1\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=3e5ef2a65a661ef851a2fe9f611982ba0bd4eed2d9fcc332cf98abd42ce5fee5]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"92fe2f3c09a59b4e9a732463a41d4a45d7efd693648159621e03c75f7127eac5\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"### Transition evidence\\n\\nA reviewable transition identifies the exact candidate, the affected\\nrelations, the changed realisation paths, the authority paths added or\\nremoved, the retained and open seams, the focused proof, any required\\nintegration proof, the explicit non-changes, and, where an assessor was\\nactivated, the assessor's recommended disposition, with the decision\\nowner's disposition beside it once one is made (§3). Consumers\\nchoose the representation. Transition evidence is a read\\nmodel; it does not become specification, design or admission authority\\n(P6, P4b).\\n\\nConstruction uses the cheapest focused proof capable of falsifying the\\nactive relation. Expensive whole-candidate qualification occurs at a\\ndeclared candidate boundary rather than after every local edit, unless the\\naffected risk makes whole-candidate proof necessary (§6). A durable or\\nreconstructable authority claim is not established solely by a same-process\\nproof when loss of incidental process state is a material counterexample:\\nthe proof destroys or excludes the incidental authority and compares the\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[1750,1768]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"56109ffa2e8ec6f158e6dbd0b387fededa685abc100a288ea88525854a78441d\",\"selected_sha256\":\"08d23dd3949b21b80e23fa46bffedff55bfa456a51e1afd8df831b5f13bbd216\",\"size_bytes\":1090,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"standards/ACTIVATION.md\",\"root\":\"method\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[1750,1768]},\"sha256\":\"56109ffa2e8ec6f158e6dbd0b387fededa685abc100a288ea88525854a78441d\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
